        {
          "text": "Nenzi dehi mwitempa dami, eyi muhelami, eyi mwenŋa wami. Nakuŋuli dehi mora yami hamu nanyiseki yami. Nadyi dehi yihehela yami hamu nawuchi wami. Nanwi dehi vinyu yami hamu namayeli ami. Enu amabwambu jami dyenu. Enu nakeŋa, nwenu, nwenu nankashi.",
